@startuml
' 04-use-case EWS tahap 1 + usulan tahap 2 — docs/proposal/04-use-case.md §4.6
left to right direction

actor TEACHER as GURU

rectangle "EWS (Early Warning System)" as SYS {
  usecase "UC12\nLihat daftar at-risk" as UC12
  usecase "Agregat kehadiran" as AG
  usecase "U-02 Tindak lanjut" as U2
  usecase "U-03 Notifikasi internal" as U3
  usecase "U-04 Eskalasi berjenjang" as U4
}

GURU -- UC12

UC12 ..> AG : <<include>>
U2 ..> UC12 : <<extend>>
U3 ..> UC12 : <<extend>>
U4 ..> UC12 : <<extend>>

note bottom of SYS
  U-02/U-03/U-04 hanya extend usulan Tahap 2.
  Tahap 1 (UC12 + agregat): human watchlist,
  tanpa notifikasi, tanpa sanksi.
  Scope: ADMIN semua, TEACHER miliknya/kelasnya,
  LABORANT via API tanpa menu UI.
end note
@enduml
